      "worked": "Since cosine is even, $\\cos(-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos(-\\theta)-\\cos\\theta&=\\cos\\theta-\\cos\\theta\\\\\\cos(-\\theta)-\\cos\\theta&=0\\end{align*}$$",
